  - title: 02 / Find home and decode direction
    explanation: "Home rotates clockwise until the unique Z pulse resets the count.
      Clockwise gives 00 \u2192 10 \u2192 11 \u2192 01 \u2192 00, so A leads. Counterclockwise
      reverses that sequence. Station A is +20 counts and Station B is +52."
    caption: "80 COUNTS PER TURN  \u2022  4.5\xB0 PER COUNT"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.12, y: 0.8}
      label: 5 V + RETURN
      color: {r: 0.28, g: 0.69, b: 1, a: 1}
    - id: encoder
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.14, y: 0.48}
      label: ENCODER
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - id: decoder
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.82, y: 0.48}
      label: DECODER
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.73, b: 0.31, a: 1}
    - id: phaseA
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.47, y: 0.64}
      label: A LEADS CW
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - id: phaseB
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.47, y: 0.3}
      label: B LEADS CCW
      color: {r: 0.28, g: 0.69, b: 1, a: 1}
    - id: index
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.47, y: 0.48}
      label: Z INDEX
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.73, b: 0.31, a: 1}
