  - title: 03 / Repair crossed A and B
    explanation: Swap the A and B leads at the decoder. TEST DIRECTION compares commanded
      clockwise travel with the decoded count. It stops after three backward counts.
      Repair both leads and re-home.
    caption: "TABLE CW  \u2022  COUNT FALLING"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.12, y: 0.8}
      label: 5 V + RETURN
      color: {r: 0.28, g: 0.69, b: 1, a: 1}
    - id: encoder
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.14, y: 0.48}
      label: ENCODER
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
