  - title: 04 / Recover the reference
    explanation: "Move to B and cycle decoder power. The platter stays at 234\xB0.
      After power-up, HOME restores a known zero. Move to B again and check that
      the position repeats."
    caption: "PHYSICAL ANGLE STAYS  \u2022  COUNT REFERENCE IS LOST"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.12, y: 0.8}
      label: 5 V + RETURN
      color: {r: 0.28, g: 0.69, b: 1, a: 1}
